###
### SAP PM-lite Core - API V2 Test Suite
### 
### Prerequisites:
### 1. Service running: pm2 start deviceService
### 2. Valid JWT token (replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
### 3. Test data: incident_id=1, maintenance_id=1, asset_id=1
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3009
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ========================================
### INCIDENT V2 ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 1. Triage Incident - Set Notification Type (M1/M2/M3/M4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/incidents/1/triage
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "severity": "critical",
  "notification_type": "M1",
  "notes": "Motor failure, production stopped - need immediate attention"
}

### 2. Isolate M1 Incident - Asset goes to DOWN status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/incidents/1/isolate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "downtime_minutes": 120,
  "isolation_reason": "Equipment breakdown - production line stopped"
}

### 3. Assign Incident to Technician
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/incidents/1/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assigned_to": 5
}

### 4. Start Working on Incident
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/incidents/1/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### 5. Resolve Incident
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/incidents/1/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "resolution": "Replaced faulty motor bearing",
  "root_cause": "Bearing wear due to lack of lubrication",
  "corrective_action": "Implemented weekly lubrication schedule"
}

### 6. Close Incident (M1 must have downtime_minutes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/incidents/1/close
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "downtime_minutes": 180
}

### 7. Get Incident Status with Asset Context
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/incidents/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### MAINTENANCE V2 ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 8. Release Work Order - REL Status (Scope Locked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/maintenance/1/release
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "scheduled_at": "2025-12-26T08:00:00Z",
  "assigned_to": 5
}

### 9. Start Work Order - Asset goes to MNTC status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/maintenance/1/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "actual_start_date": "2025-12-26T08:30:00Z"
}

### 10. TECO Work Order - TECO Status (Cost Locked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/maintenance/1/teco
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "actual_end_date": "2025-12-26T12:00:00Z",
  "actual_cost": 5000000,
  "labor_cost": 3000000,
  "material_cost": 2000000,
  "completion_notes": "All tasks completed successfully"
}

### 11. Close Work Order - Asset goes to AVLB status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/maintenance/1/close
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### 12. Get Work Order Status with Gates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/maintenance/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Test Scope Lock Enforcement (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/maintenance/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "asset_id": 999,
  "notes": "Trying to change asset after REL status"
}

### 14. Test Cost Lock Enforcement (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/maintenance/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "actual_cost": 9999999,
  "notes": "Trying to change cost after TECO status"
}

### ========================================
### REPORTS V2 ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### 15. Get MTBF/MTTR Report (M1 Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports/mtbf-mttr?asset_id=1&start_date=2025-10-01&end_date=2025-12-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Get Availability Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports/availability?asset_id=1&start_date=2025-11-01&end_date=2025-12-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Get Planned vs Unplanned Ratio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports/planned-vs-unplanned?asset_id=1&start_date=2025-10-01&end_date=2025-12-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Get Maintenance Backlog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports/backlog?asset_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Get Complete KPI Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports/asset-kpi-dashboard?asset_id=1&start_date=2025-10-01&end_date=2025-12-25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### BACKWARD COMPATIBILITY TESTS (V1 API)
### ========================================

### 20. V1 API Still Works - Get Incidents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/incidents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. V1 API Still Works - Get Maintenance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
